{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Uber Urban",
    "steam_appid": 2723660,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A modern, indie, interpretation on the well established genre of city builders; meet Uber Urban. With genre-defining mechanics as well as more innovative strategy elements, Uber Urban enables players to build the city of their dreams like never before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723660/extras/5ed02af555d33f3935c38255e5b01467.avif?t=1742788870\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Enjoy building your city with a large, ever expanding catalogue of buildings; manage your finances through taxation and demand and build a truly thriving metropolis with hundreds of thousands of inhabitants. Be careful though, as your management and construction decisions will affect the growth and success of your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723660/extras/f9f199970853ab82edcc81cbd5e3c601.avif?t=1742788870\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Every action you make, no matter how big or small, will impact your approval rating. Sign or revoke policies, by-laws, and subsidies, just as a real mayor would. Find the fine line between profits and happiness, but remember to have a majority approval rating when election time comes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723660/extras/db41ac82703dc30c5e3fc22697beeab6.avif?t=1742788870\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Manage each individual resource your city needs, control which factories make what, and balance a complex supply chain. Import or export goods to fill your citizens needs and keep you in power for another term.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723660/extras/ed5f5eb9ac1d88f7fcf799c11a7452d4.avif?t=1742788870\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Experience many more gameplay features like loans, budgeting, nature, mixed use buildings, achievements, city stats, services, demand and more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community Involvement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will be actively looking to the community while the game is in early access to see where the community wants the game to go. If you want to make a suggestion, please write a comment on the pinned <strong>feature request</strong> discussion in the games steam community page.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A modern, indie, interpretation on the well established genre of city builders; meet Uber Urban. With genre-defining mechanics as well as more innovative strategy elements, Uber Urban enables players to build the city of their dreams like never before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723660/extras/5ed02af555d33f3935c38255e5b01467.avif?t=1742788870\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Enjoy building your city with a large, ever expanding catalogue of buildings; manage your finances through taxation and demand and build a truly thriving metropolis with hundreds of thousands of inhabitants. Be careful though, as your management and construction decisions will affect the growth and success of your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723660/extras/f9f199970853ab82edcc81cbd5e3c601.avif?t=1742788870\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Every action you make, no matter how big or small, will impact your approval rating. Sign or revoke policies, by-laws, and subsidies, just as a real mayor would. Find the fine line between profits and happiness, but remember to have a majority approval rating when election time comes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723660/extras/db41ac82703dc30c5e3fc22697beeab6.avif?t=1742788870\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Manage each individual resource your city needs, control which factories make what, and balance a complex supply chain. Import or export goods to fill your citizens needs and keep you in power for another term.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723660/extras/ed5f5eb9ac1d88f7fcf799c11a7452d4.avif?t=1742788870\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Experience many more gameplay features like loans, budgeting, nature, mixed use buildings, achievements, city stats, services, demand and more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community Involvement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will be actively looking to the community while the game is in early access to see where the community wants the game to go. If you want to make a suggestion, please write a comment on the pinned <strong>feature request</strong> discussion in the games steam community page.</p>",
    "short_description": "Build your city in multiple different hand-crafted worlds and manage all the complexities that a real mayor would. From city services to demand, finances, policies, approval ratings and re-election, Uber Urban offers a complete and innovative take on the city building genre.",
